# The netlify.app URL always keeps working alongside a custom domain — Netlify
# doesn't redirect it automatically. This sends anyone who lands on it to the
# real domain instead.
#
# The `!` forces the redirect even though every path here also matches a real
# file in the build; without it Netlify serves the file instead of redirecting.
# Because the source is a full https://<host>/* URL, this only matches requests
# that arrive on the netlify.app hostname — visitors already on wiki.nqub.com
# never hit this rule, so there's no redirect loop.
https://nqub-wiki.netlify.app/*  https://wiki.nqub.com/:splat  301!
